# Source images stay out of the repo: the large originals are heavy, and the
# officials' portraits are already cropped into the theme where they are used.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash so this matches only the folder at the top of
# the project. Unanchored, git on macOS matches case-insensitively and would
# also swallow the theme's own assets/images/ directory — taking the town seal
# and every portrait with it.
/Images/
/Images /
